Cell["\<\
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]SchmidtBasis\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] returns the same \
state re-expressed in its own Schmidt bases, as a state object carrying those \
bases:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9947756555545406`*^9, 
  3.9947756573429737`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a7578b6d-1c49-124e-b9d0-\
bfcfdf1ed612"],

